                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is Wakao's biggest advantage?</h3>
                                        <p>Jackfruit as India-native + affordable + sustainable plant meat. Category creation with local advantages vs Western plant meat competitors.</p>
                                        <h3>Can new plant-based brands compete?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes in ingredient / cuisine niching. Specific plant proteins + regional Indian cuisine adaptations + specific health-benefit positioning create space.</p>
                                        <h3>Is plant-based a real long-term category?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes — global plant-based market growing 15-25% annually. India + international both growing. Compounding health + sustainability tailwinds.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the biggest plant-based lesson?</h3>
                                        <p>Leverage local advantages (native ingredients, cultural familiarity, price accessibility) instead of copying Western plant meat playbooks.</p>
